1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,841
People often know the story behind a real-world asset.

2
00:00:03,841 --> 00:00:06,106
But not what the token actually gives them.

3
00:00:06,106 --> 00:00:09,973
TrueGuard connects the real asset to the onchain product.

4
00:00:09,973 --> 00:00:14,440
It checks what the user wants, and links every important claim to proof.

5
00:00:14,440 --> 00:00:23,880
And when matching small holders want to sell, ExitTogether pools their orders to seek one large-order quote, while each holder keeps a minimum.

6
00:00:23,880 --> 00:00:24,856
TrueGuard.

7
00:00:24,856 --> 00:00:25,989
Understand it.

8
00:00:25,989 --> 00:00:27,161
Verify it.

9
00:00:27,161 --> 00:00:28,450
Exit together.

